    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about resting though. i feel like i'm stuck in this loop. and the worst part is that it's so quiet. there isn't even a big explosion of pain or anything, it's just... silence. i look at the world and it just feels like it's on the other side of a glass wall. i just want the silence to be permanent. i want to finally be able to stop feeling nothing.",
